    r"\b("
    r"cooked|boiled|braised|stewed|steamed|roasted|toasted|baked|grilled|"
    r"broiled|fried|sauteed|poached|smoked|cured|canned|bottled|jarred|"
    r"prepared|precooked|pre[\s-]?cooked|ready[\s-]?to[\s-]?eat|"
